pr_body:
This PR adds support for an ILM action that downsamples a time-series index by invoking the `_rollup` endpoint (#85708)

A  policy that includes the rollup action will look like the following

```json
PUT _ilm/policy/my_policy
{
  "policy": {
    "phases": {
      "warm": {
        "actions": {
          "rollup": {
  	    "fixed_interval": "24h"
  	  }
  	}
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Relates to https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/74660
Fixes https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/68609

Finally, this PR is based on the code written for https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/68184

